        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana BBS2001, Sobe Single Roll Solid Brass Toilet Paper Holder</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade with the quality that Deltana is known for, this Single Post Sobe Toilet Paper Holder is constructed out of solid brass. It is available beautiful finishes. Depending on the the finish, this toilet paper roll holder will look great in both traditional and contemporary decors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBS2001-specifications.gif?v=1704354572\" width=\"527\" height=\"245\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana BBS2001 Toilet Paper Holder Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana BBS Sobe Series\"><b>Deltana Sobe Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Sobe Toilet Paper Roll Holder:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Arm Length: 6-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Arm Height: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Mount Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Reversible to hang in either direction.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting for a clean, contemporary look.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBS2001.pdf?v=1691095358\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana BBS2001 Toilet Paper Holder Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 toilet tissue holder, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
